      "reference_answer": "A unique head-related transfer function depends on a person's head, ears, and ear canal, so measuring each user's function is impractical and an average listener's function is used. A pair of head-related transfer functions for both ears can synthesize binaural sound. Generating or placing sound effects according to this model creates a localization effect in an extended reality system.",
